            set wrappedStatus to the cad split containment of cutter at (0.5 * (highAlong + lowAlong + closedPeriod's amount)) on (@intrinsic("dereference", surfaceNode)) bounded by boundaryCurves with periods periods within tolerance requiring clearance false
            if (directStatus's valid and wrappedStatus's valid) = false:
